msgctxt "96"
msgid "You gonna see the kid off, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Hey, kid. I know things were kinda tough for you today, but\r\n"
"I hope it didn't color your opinion of Tokyo too bad. Come back someday, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I will. Thanks for everything. Oh and, uh... take care of Aniki for "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"That's a real hoot, kid. Kiryu doesn't need anyone taking\r\n"
"care of him. Anyway, have a good flight. Later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Come on, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "What're you gonna do with the kid, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "I'm sending him home. It's too dangerous for him to stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Agreed. You might wanna at least take him to the taxi after all\r\n"
"he's been through, though. It's only fair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Yeah, I was planning on it."
msgstr ""

